 history and status of gastric precancerous lesions with chronological and clusteranalysis of cited articles</article-title><source>Acta Acad Med CPAPF</source><year>2002</year><volume>10</volume><fpage>249</fpage><lpage>251</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B18"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Ochiai</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><article-title>Zoographic studies on the solenoid fishes found in Japan and its neighbouring regions</article-title><source>Bull Japan Soc Sci Fish</source><year>1957</year><volume>22</volume><fpage>526</fpage><lpage>530</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B19"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Tseng</surname><given-names>YH</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>CJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lin</surname><given-names>YI</given-names></name><article-title>Text mining techniques for patent analysis</article-title><source>Inform Process Manag</source><year>2007</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>1216</fpage><lpage>1247</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ipm.2006.11.011</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B20"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Prime</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Bassecoulard</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Zitt</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><article-title>Co-citations and co-sitations: A cautionary view on an analogy</article-title><source>Scientometrics</source><year>2002</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>291</fpage><lpage>308</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1016022214005</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B21"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Zubiete</surname><given-names>CL</given-names></name><article-title>An application of co-citation based visualisation techniques in the field of film studies</article-title><source>Prof De La Inform</source><year>2006</year><volume>15</volume><fpage>251</fpage><lpage>257</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.3145/epi.2006.jul.02</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B22"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Schildt</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mattsson</surname><given-names>JT</given-names></name><article-title>A dense network sub-grouping algorithm for co-citation analysis and its implementation in the software tool Sitkis</article-title><source>Scientometrics</source><year>2006</year><volume>67</volume><fpage>143</fpage><lpage>163</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1007/s11192-006-0054-8</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B23"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Reid</surname><given-names>EF</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name><article-title>Mapping the contemporary terrorism research domain</article-title><source>Int J Hum-Comput St</source><year>2007</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>42</fpage><lpage>56</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijhcs.2006.08.006</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B24"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Marx</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Schier</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wanitschek</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><article-title>Citation analysis using online databases: feasibilities and shorcomings</article-title><source>Scientometrics</source><year>2001</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>59</fpage><lpage>82</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1023/A:1012798911792</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>